# Habit Tracker 2026 — Implementation Plan

## Overview
Rebuild the default Expo template into a minimalistic, black-and-white habit tracker with:
- Local SQLite persistence
- A weekly habit grid (heat map of consistency)
- A mood score line chart
- 4 bottom tabs: Today, Dashboard, Learn (placeholder), Profile (placeholder)

---

## 1. Dependencies to install
- `expo-sqlite` — local SQLite database
- `react-native-svg` — for the mood line chart (lightweight, no heavy chart lib)

---

## 2. app.json changes
- Set `userInterfaceStyle: "light"` (lock to light mode)

---

## 3. Database layer — `db/`

**`db/database.ts`**
- Initialize SQLite with `expo-sqlite`
- Run migrations on first launch:
  ```sql
  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS habits (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    name TEXT NOT NULL,
    created_at TEXT NOT NULL
  );
  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS habit_logs (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    habit_id INTEGER NOT NULL,
    date TEXT NOT NULL,         -- YYYY-MM-DD
    status TEXT NOT NULL,       -- 'completed' | 'skipped'
    UNIQUE(habit_id, date),
    FOREIGN KEY (habit_id) REFERENCES habits(id)
  );
  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS mood_logs (
    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
    date TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,  -- YYYY-MM-DD
    morning INTEGER,            -- 1–10
    evening INTEGER             -- 1–10
  );
  ```

**`db/queries.ts`**
- `getHabits()`, `addHabit(name)`, `deleteHabit(id)`
- `getLogsForWeek(weekStart)` — returns all logs for the 7-day window
- `upsertLog(habitId, date, status)` — toggle completed/skipped/none
- `getMoodLogs(weekStart)` — 7 days of mood data
- `upsertMoodLog(date, morning, evening)`

---

## 4. State — `context/HabitsContext.tsx`
React Context + useReducer holding:
- `habits: Habit[]`
- `logs: HabitLog[]` (current week)
- `moodLogs: MoodLog[]` (current week)
- `selectedWeekStart: string` (YYYY-MM-DD, defaults to current week's Sunday)

Actions: `LOAD`, `TOGGLE_LOG`, `ADD_HABIT`, `DELETE_HABIT`, `SET_MOOD`, `SET_WEEK`

---

## 5. File / folder structure after changes

```
app/
  _layout.tsx               — root layout: SQLite init, HabitsProvider, force light mode
  (tabs)/
    _layout.tsx             — bottom tabs (Today, Dashboard, Learn, Profile)
    index.tsx               — Today: list of today's habits with toggle
    dashboard.tsx           — Dashboard: week selector + heat map grid + mood chart
    learn.tsx               — Learn placeholder
    profile.tsx             — Profile placeholder
  add-habit.tsx             — Modal: add new habit (simple text input)

db/
  database.ts
  queries.ts

context/
  HabitsContext.tsx

components/
  WeekHeader.tsx            — Su Mo Tu We Th Fr Sa row with dates
  HabitGridRow.tsx          — one habit row × 7 day cells
  DayCell.tsx               — single cell (black=completed, light gray=empty, X=skipped)
  MoodChart.tsx             — SVG polyline chart with tooltip dot
  HabitToggle.tsx           — checkmark row for Today screen
```

---

## 6. UI design tokens (black & white only)
```
background:      #FFFFFF
text primary:    #000000
text secondary:  #888888
cell-completed:  #1A1A1A  (near black)
cell-partial:    #555555  (medium gray — not used yet, reserved)
cell-skipped:    #F0F0F0  (very light gray + "×" mark)
cell-empty:      #E5E5E5  (light gray)
border:          #E5E5E5
tab bar bg:      #FFFFFF
```
No colors. No dark mode. Pure monochrome.

---

## 7. Screen details

### Today (index.tsx)
- Date header "Today, May 29"
- Scrollable list of habits, each with a rounded square toggle (tap = complete, hold = skip)
- "+" FAB → navigates to add-habit modal
- Empty state if no habits yet

### Dashboard (dashboard.tsx)
- "Dashboard" header + "+" to add habit
- Week selector (< prev | Su–Sa dates | next >)
- Habit heat-map grid: rows = habits, columns = days
  - Cell tap cycles: empty → completed → skipped → empty
- "Mood score >" section header (tappable, navigates to mood detail — future)
- SVG line chart: daily avg mood score for the week, with a dot tooltip on today

### Add Habit modal (add-habit.tsx)
- Single text input "Habit name"
- "Add" button

---

## 8. Implementation order
1. Install deps + update app.json
2. `db/database.ts` + `db/queries.ts`
3. `context/HabitsContext.tsx`
4. Root `_layout.tsx` (init DB, wrap providers)
5. Tab `_layout.tsx` (4 tabs, icons)
6. `DayCell`, `WeekHeader`, `HabitGridRow` components
7. `MoodChart` component (react-native-svg polyline)
8. `dashboard.tsx` screen (assembles components)
9. `HabitToggle` component
10. `index.tsx` Today screen
11. `add-habit.tsx` modal
12. `learn.tsx` + `profile.tsx` placeholders
13. Wire up add/delete habits end-to-end
14. Polish: fonts, spacing, animations (Reanimated scale on cell tap)
